  "2026-11-21T15:08:38.943Z",codex-sol,The latest CodeQL check clears the regex alert. Its remaining medium trace connects the active launcher path to default installer calls that cannot take that branch. The subprocess boundary forces shell false. Greptile found two Round FR regressions in the status-only conditional path and the continued npm fallback. Add paired fixtures for these related findings.
  "2026-11-21T15:10:50.456Z",codex-sol,Round FR follow-up mapping. Commit 7b18e03 covers PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66YLU3 and supplements VuXV by keeping the renderer through status-only conditional branches. The same commit covers PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66YLU8 and supplements VuXQ by independently loading the npm fallback when continuation has a recorded active setting. Both regressions reproduced and pass with their inverse fixtures. The pinned fleet scan still accepts 142 hooks and 144 bodies. CodeQL alert 27 remains open. Static triage found that the supplied trace combines mutually exclusive lookup modes and reaches a wrapper that forces shell false.
  "2026-11-21T17:06:08.002Z",codex-sol,"Round FT on 56a4f84 starts with paired regression and acceptance fixtures for the release hook reader, npm launcher policy, adapter output, and snapshot coverage."
  "2026-11-21T17:14:47.495Z",codex-sol,"Round FT paired checks reproduced the hook reader, adapter output, sparse snapshot, lifecycle discovery, and fixture-environment failures at 56a4f84. A synthetic npm installation without the Windows launchers also reproduced the host-dependent copy failure. The pinned fleet scan before and after the fixes accepted 142 hook roots and reached 144 script bodies across 39 manifests."
  "2026-11-21T17:29:33.061Z",codex-sol,Targeted runtime coverage exposed two missing lookup controls after the main fix. The added cases cover empty PATH entries outside the POSIX lifecycle probe and a batch launcher that remains ineligible even when its adjacent Node is verified. The runtime suite passed all nine cases with 100% coverage in all four dimensions.
  "2026-11-21T17:37:23.183Z",codex-sol,"The focused suite found that inline boolean validation changed the refusal for a dynamic date flag. The paired fixtures preserve the unresolved-option diagnostic for dynamic date and package selectors. Literal inline booleans are refused, while inline version values and dynamic title data are still accepted."
  "2026-11-21T18:11:45.229Z",codex-sol,Round FT review map. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66Ynw1 uses 8b436fe and 585c24c to refuse inline package-version selector values and retain the unresolved-option diagnostic. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66Ynw5 uses 8b436fe to preserve alternative renderers in OR lists and script forwards. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66YnxA uses 8b436fe to pass the adapter's resolved output path to the generator. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66YnxE uses 8b436fe and fdf945a to require a verified Node for stock Windows launchers. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66YnxG uses 8b436fe and fdf945a to honor empty POSIX PATH entries in the lifecycle probe. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66YnxI uses 8b436fe to clear both npm lifecycle environment spellings in the fixture. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66YnxL uses 8b436fe to use a known npm launcher in the heading-date fixture. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66YnxO uses 8b436fe to refuse sparse snapshot omissions and preserve genuine deletions. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66YnxQ uses 8b436fe and fdf945a to use pinned fixture-owned Windows launcher templates and retain shim refusal. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M650IRm and PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M650SdF uses 24d844c to accept quoted ordinary title data and refuse inherited generator or policy selection. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M650SdV uses 24d844c to require a fresh preview in each lifecycle row. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M650Sda uses accb464 to disable tag signing locally in both disposable repositories. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M650Sdd uses accb464 to inject invalid UTF-8 into Git indexes without using an invalid filesystem name.
  "2026-11-21T18:18:45.291Z",codex-sol,Standalone coverage reached 2200 passing tests and 100% in all four dimensions over 54 source files. The rewritten candidate matched that coverage but the publish audit correctly classified the verbatim shell shebang in the launcher fixture as executable source. The paired fixture preserves the real workflow in the tracked source scan and stores the exact launcher bytes as test data. The publish audit's source rules are unchanged.
  "2026-11-21T18:20:40.765Z",codex-sol,PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66YnxQ also maps to 8156384 for keeping the pinned fixture as data. Both template hashes matched the upstream npm 11.21.0 templates after decoding. The tracked source regression and the real publish-attestation gate both passed.
  "2026-11-21T18:37:49.396Z",codex-sol,"Round FT final local verification passed. Standalone npm run coverage on 585c24c passed 2200 tests with 100% statements, branches, functions and lines across 54 sources. The rewritten release acceptance on 8156384 passed its complete release gate with 2201 passing tests, zero failures, two opt-in real-repository skips, and the same four 100% results. Typecheck, lint, zero duplication, docstrings, changelog:check, publisher attestation and lifecycle checks passed. Regeneration after fetching tags was byte-identical with ops-b2bs under Unreleased. The pinned fleet accepted 142 hooks and reached 144 bodies across 39 manifests, with no renderer refusals."
  "2026-11-21T19:29:08.020Z",codex-sol,"Round FV starts from 2ce0430. Add paired regressions before implementation, then repeat the release suites, fleet scan, and full coverage gate."
  "2026-11-21T19:38:35.769Z",codex-sol,All five Round FV findings reproduced in paired local fixtures. The pinned baseline and the candidate fleet scans each accepted 142 hooks and reached 144 script bodies across 39 manifests. The active and configured npm policies are now carried independently through preparation and continuation.
  "2026-11-21T19:45:53.715Z",codex-sol,"Round FV thread map. GitHub returned all 222 review threads, with these five open at 2ce0430. 7c2d9bd fixes PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66bVVX by binding the prepared active and nested npm policies, PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66bVVb by preserving uncertainty after a possibly unset expansion, PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66bVVd by identifying the destination of a changelog copy, PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66bVVe by retaining the renderer across literal redirect-only segments, and PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66bVVh by withholding editable spans from decoded backquotes. Historical controls: PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M650IRm and PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M650SdF map to 24d844c for ordinary data acceptance and executable or policy refusal. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M650SdV maps to 24d844c for fresh per-row previews. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M650Sda and PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M650Sdd map to accb464 for local tag signing isolation and raw index injection. Related predecessors PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66VuXL maps to 424dc59 and 91c0b2c for failed reads, with the unset case in 7c2d9bd. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66YLU3 and PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66YLU8 map to 7b18e03, with redirect and receipt coverage in 7c2d9bd."
  "2026-11-21T20:28:17.513Z",codex-sol,"Round FV gates passed on the 7c2d9bd code. The exact baseline passed 495 cases. The focused gate passed 13 cases, the 32 reference suites passed 1555 with two opt-in skips, and the hostile tag-signing and raw-index controls passed three cases. Standalone npm run coverage and the rewritten release-heading acceptance each passed 2206 tests with zero failures and two opt-in skips, with 100 percent statements, branches, functions and lines across 54 sources. Typecheck, test build, lint, zero duplication, docstrings and changelog:check passed. The pinned fleet scan accepted 142 hooks and reached 144 bodies across 39 manifests, including renderer preparation. Changelog regeneration retained ops-b2bs under Unreleased."
  "2026-11-21T20:36:00.059Z",codex-sol,Greptile thread PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66b_zV on 39b5d1f reproduced locally. A trailing cp backup suffix was treated as the destination. Paired fixtures now cover copies into and out of CHANGELOG.md with short and long suffix options.
  "2026-11-21T20:53:31.327Z",codex-sol,"Greptile PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66b_zV maps to local commit b61e213. The 128 grammar and runtime cases passed, GNU cp verified both copy directions, and the destination helper exercised all 17 branches. Typecheck, lint, duplication, docstrings and changelog:check passed. The pinned fleet accepted 142 hooks and reached 144 bodies across 39 manifests. The full follow-up reruns are bounded by the original post-push deadline. The PR head remains 39b5d1f pending those gates."
  "2026-11-21T21:29:05.408Z",codex-sol,Round FX started. Verify the current review threads and cover both refusal and acceptance before changing release behavior.
  "2026-11-21T21:40:38.916Z",codex-sol,Round FX reproduced the review cases on the starting code. The fleet baseline accepted 142 hooks and 144 reachable bodies from 39 manifests. The Vienna fixture reproduced the wrong configured value with a controlled global npmrc.
  "2026-11-21T21:48:00.655Z",codex-sol,"Round FX thread map. GitHub returned eight open threads on 556afe4. 8ba589e maps PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66chXF to verifying nested npm fallback after earlier code runs, PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66chXJ to producer-effective GITHUB_ENV values, PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66chXO to directory copy destinations, PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66chXR to AND-list renderer alternatives, PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66chXU to case-equivalent Windows npm keys, PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66chXV to native PATHEXT order, PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66chXY to hyphenated env assignments, and PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66chXa to isolated Vienna npm configuration. Historical controls PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M650IRm and PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M650SdF map to 24d844c for quoted title acceptance and inherited executable or policy refusal. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M650SdV maps to 24d844c for fresh per-row previews. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M650Sda and PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M650Sdd map to accb464 for fixture tag-signing isolation and raw index UTF-8 refusal."
  "2026-11-21T22:09:52.431Z",codex-sol,The broader run caught a compatibility regression in the first nested-policy guard. Its inverse fixture now requires the previously enabled pre-hook to remain in the audited graph. The revised guard applies where an implicit reload can enable a skipped hook.
  "2026-11-21T22:11:48.175Z",codex-sol,"Round FX follow-up. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66chXF maps to 8ba589e and 5418890. The guard refuses a mutable fallback when it could enable a skipped hook. The stable enabled case still audits both siblings. The paired preparation, date audit and policy drift tests passed with npm 11.21.0."
  "2026-11-21T22:17:42.429Z",codex-sol,Round FX compatibility follow-up 8345bb0 supplements PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66chXF and PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66chXR. Standard generators with default paths preserve the nested config model. Terminal status commands retain the prior ambiguity check and AND-list status chains keep the renderer before an OR fallback. The complete grammar and shell suites passed 152 cases. The starting revision passed 397 cases. The fleet accepted 142 hooks and 144 bodies across 39 manifests.
  "2026-11-21T22:50:13.343Z",codex-sol,"Round FX verified all 13 thread mappings. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66chXF uses 8ba589e, 5418890 and 8345bb0 for nested lifecycle preparation and compatibility. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66chXR uses 8ba589e and 8345bb0 for renderer alternatives and terminal status checks. 8ba589e fixes PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66chXJ for effective GITHUB_ENV literals, PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66chXO for directory copy destinations, PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66chXU for case-equivalent Windows npm keys, PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66chXV for native PATHEXT order, PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66chXY for hyphenated env assignments, and PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66chXa for isolated Vienna npm configuration. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M650IRm and PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M650SdF map to 24d844c for inherited title acceptance and executable or policy selection refusal. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M650SdV maps to 24d844c for fresh preview assertions. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M650Sda and PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M650Sdd map to accb464 for tag signing isolation and raw invalid UTF-8 index fixtures."
  "2026-11-21T22:50:14.151Z",codex-sol,"Round FX gates passed on 8345bb0. The starting revision passed 397 tests. Grammar and shell passed 152, real workflow controls passed four, and the 31 reference suites passed 1527 with two skips. Standalone npm run coverage and the rewritten node test/release-heading-full-gate.acceptance.ts each passed 2215 tests with two skips and 100 percent statements, branches, functions and lines over 54 measured sources. The artifact-reader checks passed in both runs. Typecheck, test compilation, lint, zero duplication, docstrings and changelog:check passed. The acceptance also passed both dependency audits, packing and release verifiers. The baseline and final fleet scans accepted 142 hooks and 144 bodies across 39 manifests. Changelog regeneration was byte-identical and retains ops-b2bs under Unreleased."
  "2026-11-21T23:31:16.813Z",codex-sol,"Round FY starts from 1bbecd4. Verify the review findings against the pinned npm and changelog behavior, add refusal and acceptance fixtures, then run package and fleet gates."
  "2026-11-21T23:38:46.187Z",codex-sol,"Round FY reproduced the workflow environment, npm ordering, pinned parser, renderer, workspace and shell cases. Baseline and updated fleet scans each accepted 142 release hooks and 144 script bodies across 39 manifests. The old full-gate fixture resolved an existing tag. The updated fixture checks a different untagged release coordinate."
  "2026-11-21T23:50:38.657Z",codex-sol,Verified that a separate pm-arg with an empty or absent value must fail and an npm caller can still forward an option-shaped value. The full-gate fixture uses the same daily-release module as the workflow to stamp package metadata. Rechecking the final revision with npm 11.21.0.
  "2026-11-22T00:10:21.434Z",codex-sol,"Round FY thread map. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66dfng and PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66dfni map to 0a8465c for conditional env-file writes and bare success(). PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66dfnl maps to 0a8465c for npm environment entry ordering. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66dfno maps to 0a8465c and 80c7131 for the pinned pm-changelog operand rules. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66dfnp maps to 0a8465c for trailing AND-list status checks. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66dfnr maps to 0a8465c for refusing npm workspace configuration. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66dfnt maps to 0a8465c for quoted exec options. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66dfnw maps to 0a8465c for fixture script-shell aliases. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M66dfny maps to 0a8465c and 80c7131 for an untagged, workflow-stamped fixture that asserts both rendered headings. Reverified prior PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M650IRm and PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M650SdF at 24d844c for inherited ordinary values and executable or policy selectors. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M650SdV remains covered by 24d844c for fresh preview artifacts. PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M650Sda and PRRT_kwDOTOTl1M650Sdd remain covered by accb464 for tag signing isolation and raw invalid UTF-8 index fixtures. GitHub returned nine open Round FY threads. The five earlier thread IDs above are carried verification."
  "2026-11-22T00:17:42.088Z",codex-sol,"The reference suite caught two prior refusals for multiple renderers within one AND-list. The correction limits the trailing-status fallback to the same command list, preserves refusal for multiple renderers there, and accepts setup commands from an earlier list. Eight renderer regressions passed."
